Undead Bane Weapon	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Transmutation	COMPS:V, S, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	ITEM:Potion	TARGETAREA:Weapon touched	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) hours	SAVEINFO:Will negates (harmless)	SPELLRES:Yes (harmless)	CLASSES:Paladin=3|Cleric=4	DESC:Against undead weapon acts as if enhancement bonus +2 higher and deals an extra 2d6 damage.	SOURCELONG:Libris Mortis: The Book of the Dead	SOURCESHORT:Lm	SOURCEPAGE:p.72	SOURCEDATE:2004-10
View of Undeath	TYPE:Arcane.Divine	SCHOOL:Necromancy	DESCRIPTOR:Evil	COMPS:V, S, M	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Personal	TARGETAREA:You	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL*10) minutes	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	SOURCELONG:Libris Mortis: The Book of the Dead	SOURCESHORT:Lm	SOURCEPAGE:p.72	SOURCEDATE:2004-10
Wither Limb	TYPE:Divine	SCHOOL:Necromancy	DESCRIPTOR:Evil	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Close	TARGETAREA:Limbs of one humanoid	DURATION:Permanent	SAVEINFO:Fortitude negates	SPELLRES:Yes	DOMAINS:Deathbound=4	DESC:Caster choose whether to wither the arms or legs; legs force the victim prone and reduce movement to 5 ft.; arms makes it impossible to cast somantic or use objects.	SOURCELONG:Libris Mortis: The Book of the Dead	SOURCESHORT:Lm	SOURCEPAGE:p.72	SOURCEDATE:2004-10

###Block: Descriptions
Haunt Shift.MOD	DESC:See text for details.
Necrotic Awareness.MOD	DESC:Sense the presence of a necrotic cyst.
Necrotic Bloat.MOD	DESC:Cause an existing cyst to pulse and swell causing (min(CASTERLEVEL,10))d6 damage, half is considered vile damage.
Necrotic Burst.MOD	DESC:Failed save target dies, successful save causes (min(CASTERLEVEL,15))d6 damage, half is considered vile damage.
Necrotic Cyst.MOD	DESC:Creates necrotic cyst in target.
Necrotic Domination.MOD	DESC:As dominate person but effects any humaniod with a necrotic cyst.
Necrotic Empowerment.MOD	DESC:Gain +8 enhancement to Dex, Int and Wis, a +8 natural AC bonus, +5 fort save and 100 temp HP.
Necrotic Eruption.MOD	DESC:Cause a cyst to explosively enlarge, if target succeeds he take the damage if fails those within 20 ft. take damage and he is dead. (min(CASTERLEVEL,15))d6.
Necrotic Scrying.MOD	DESC:Scry on bearer of cyst [see or hear your choice].
Necrotic Tumor.MOD	DESC:Control or dominate a cyst bearer.
Necrotic Termination.MOD	DESC:Cause cyst to enlarge causing (min(CASTERLEVEL,25))d6, if subject fails save he is dead.
View of Undeath.MOD	DESC:Gain all the template of being undead without becoming undead for the duration of the spell.

